{"ref":"BDB, רֹעַ","hw":"רֹעַ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">רֹעַ</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>badness, evil</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:19\" href=\"/Genesis.41.19\">Gn 41:19</a> + 4 times Je; cstr. <a data-ref=\"Hosea 9:15\" href=\"/Hosea.9.15\">Ho 9:15</a> + 13 times;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>badness, bad quality</em>, of cattle <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:19\" href=\"/Genesis.41.19\">Gn 41:19</a> (E), figs <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 24:2\" href=\"/Jeremiah.24.2\">Je 24:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 24:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.24.3\">3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 24:8\" href=\"/Jeremiah.24.8\">8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 29:17\" href=\"/Jeremiah.29.17\">29:17</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>wilfulness</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">רֹעַ לבב</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:28\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.28\">1 S 17:28</a> (Gerber<sup>161</sup> makes <strong>2</strong> and <strong>4</strong> [inf. of] vb.).<br><strong>3.</strong>  ethical, <em>evil, badness</em>, only in phr.: <span dir=\"rtl\">רֹעַ מעללים</span> <em>evil of doings</em> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:20\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.20\">Dt 28:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.16\">Is 1:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 4:4\" href=\"/Jeremiah.4.4\">Je 4:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 21:12\" href=\"/Jeremiah.21.12\">21:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 23:2\" href=\"/Jeremiah.23.2\">23:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 23:22\" href=\"/Jeremiah.23.22\">22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 25:5\" href=\"/Jeremiah.25.5\">25:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 26:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.26.3\">26:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 44:22\" href=\"/Jeremiah.44.22\">44:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Hosea 9:15\" href=\"/Hosea.9.15\">Ho 9:15</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 28:4\" href=\"/Psalms.28.4\">ψ 28:4</a> (cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">רַע מעללים</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:3\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.3\">1 S 25:3</a>).<br><strong>4.</strong>  <em>sadness</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳ פָּנִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 7:3\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.7.3\">Ec 7:3</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳ לֵב</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 2:2\" href=\"/Nehemiah.2.2\">Ne 2:2</a> (cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">[רַעַע]</span> <strong>2</strong>).","next":"BDB, רַע²","prev":"BDB, רעע"}